# ============================================================
#
# SUMO_DIR
#     Directory containing SUMO simulation files.
#
# network_file
#     Generated 2 × 2 traffic-light-controlled network.
#
# route_file
#     Reproducible random traffic demand.
#
# config_file
#     SUMO simulation configuration.
#
